From 20d9e488acafc676a7b3ac89896f6538a3727def Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Daniel Campos Ramos <Capitain_Jack@yahoo.com>
Date: Thu, 19 Nov 2026 05:08:39 -0300
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] Port Fraqtive to Qt 6

qmake 6 and configure accept it, Qt 6's QOpenGLWidget module, setContentsMargins,
std::sort, QElapsedTimer, QScreen, the wheel event's angleDelta() and position(),
qRegisterMetaType for the stream operators, QStyleOptionFrame, Qt::SkipEmptyParts,
QPixmapCache::find with a pointer, QPalette::Window.

Assisted-by: Claude Sonnet via Claude Code
